==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level can be easily beat by sending out [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] and meatshielding. Any units such as [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and/or [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]] may also be worth bringing along to complete the stage faster.

